<title>BOLIVIA: SOCCER-ARGENTINA AND ECUADOR DRAW 0-0 IN COPA AMERICA.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-ARGENTINA AND ECUADOR DRAW 0-0 IN COPA AMERICA.</headline>
<dateline>COCHABAMBA, Bolivia 1997-06-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ecuador and</p>
<p>Argentina drew 0-0 in a Copa America first round group A match</p>
<p>on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Attendance: 18,000</p>
<p>Standings (tabulate under played, won, drawn, lost, goals</p>
<p>for, goals against, points)</p>
<p> Paraguay	  1  1  0  0  1  0  3</p>
<p> Argentina	 1  0  1  0  0  0  1</p>
<p> Ecuador	   1  0  1  0  0  0  1</p>
<p> Chile	     1  0  0  1  0  1  0</p>
<p>Note: top two teams in each group plus the two</p>
<p>third-placed teams with the best records qualify for the</p>
<p>quarter-finals.</p>
</text>
